Copy this file to crashbox-dsn.local (gitignored) and put the dedicated
Seedbed Crashbox DSN in it, on one line, for a distributed pilot build.

    https://<public-key>@ingest.crashbox.dev/<numeric-project-id>

Never commit the real file. Packaging accepts only that canonical collector
shape and refuses a hosted or alternate destination. It also refuses to
continue if this file and the
legacy hosted-Sentry file are both populated, so a release has exactly one
destination and never dual-sends.

Without either local file the packaged app carries an empty reporting address
and cannot send anything regardless of the user preference. An allowed rollback
restores a retained source-identified artifact that reports to Crashbox or
nowhere. A hosted-Sentry build is not a rollback target.
